        "bodyHtml": "Rengar's next 2 Attacks gain <span>40% Attack Speed</span>. The first Attack deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(20/55/90/125/160 + (100% Attack Damage) + (5% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Max Ferocity:</span> The first Attack deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(35 + (100% Attack Damage) + (20% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and grants Rengar <span>50% Attack Speed</span> for 5 seconds.",
