        "bodyHtml": "Rengar throws a bola, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(55/100/145/190/235 + (80% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to the first enemy hit, revealing and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 30/45/60/75/90% for 1.75 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Max Ferocity:</span> Deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(50 + (80% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Roots</span> for 1.75 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Reveals enemies for 2 seconds.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span>Bola Strike</span> has no cast time when leaping.</span>",
