      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "RengarR",
        "name": "Thrill of the Hunt",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Rengar's predatory instincts take over, <font color='#cd90ee'>Camouflaging</font> him and revealing the nearest enemy champion in a large radius around him. During Thrill of the Hunt, Rengar gains Move Speed and he can leap to the tracked enemy without being in brush, reducing their armor.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Rengar will also leap Attack when <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Camouflaged</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Rengar gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">40/50/60% Move Speed</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">True Sight</span> in a small area around the nearest enemy champion for 12/16/20 seconds.<br /><br />After 2 seconds, Rengar becomes <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Camouflaged</span> and can leap without being in Brush. Leaping to the nearest champion deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100% Attack Damage) physical damage</span>, shreds <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">15/20/25 Armor</span> for 4 seconds, and ends this Ability.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Camouflaged</span> units cannot be seen unless an enemy champion is inside their detection radius.</span>",
